  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Housing for Internally Displaced Persons (IOM) III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aiming to improve the living conditions of IDPs in Ukraine, IOM proposes to expand its housing programme with the overall objective of diversifying and increasing IDPs&#x2019; and other conflict-affected populations&#x2019; opportunities to access affordable and social housing in selected municipalities of Kirovogradska and Poltavska oblasts. Over the course of five years, the project  will add 350-400 units to the affordable housing stock (80% of constructed housing units) and the social housing stock (20% of the constructed housing units).</narrative>
  </description>
